+// Phase: dark-mode table fix. The `color` overrides below were already
+// correct, but Bootstrap paints each cell's background from its own
+// `--bs-table-bg` custom property (defaults to `--bs-body-bg`, i.e.
+// white) — that var was never remapped for `[data-theme="dark"]`, so
+// every table cell kept a white background while the text color above
